      "type": "text",
      "text": "This section provides a comprehensive reference for all meds encountered in ACLS. Dosing is for adult pts unless otherwise specified. meds are presented per 2025 AHA guidelines. Always verify current institutional protocols & package inserts. The 2025 guidelines explicitly state that IV access is preferred over IO for drug administration in cardiac arrest."
